    <Major>BM Beyblade</Major>
    <Description>This macro use "iframe" abilities quickly and  makes you turn around enemies like a beyblade. Make them mind blowing and enjoy them. You can use cc abilities after macro stopped. 

Note:User must be in "draw stance" before run this macro.

Note: I recommend to use this macro after opponents use their "cc break ability(Tab)".

Enjoy!</Description>
